      "extractedText": "Based on the packaging label provided in the image, here is the complete transcription of all the text declarations following Legal Metrology standards:\n\n### **Text Declarations:**\n\n* **Product Name & Type:** ALCOHOL (DENATURED) DISINFECTANT HAND SANITIZER / DETTOL INSTANT HAND SANITIZER\n* **Key Benefits:** Dettol Hand Sanitizer kills 99.9% of germs instantly, without water. Use anytime, anywhere: car, office, handbag, picnics, nappy change, travel, sports etc. Leaves your hands refreshed. Use as often as required.\n* **Ingredients:** Alcohol IP (Denatured) eq. to absolute alcohol 72.34% v/v, Water, PEG/PPG-17/6 Copolymer, Propylene Glycol, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Tetrahydroxypropylethylenediamine, Perfume.\n* **How to Use:** Take a thumbnail size drop on your palm and rub your hands briskly until dry.\n* **Caution:** Keep away from fire or flame and children. Avoid use on/around eyes, ears, mouth, genitalia, broken/irritated skin or large areas of body. In case of contact with eye, rinse thoroughly with water. In case of irritation, discontinue use. Consult a doctor if irritation persists or product is swallowed.\n* **FOR EXTERNAL USE ONLY.**\n* **Storage Condition:** Store in a Cool, Dry Place.\n* **Net Vol.:** 60ml\n* **MRP (Incl. of all taxes):** \u20b9 45 *Promo Price (Overwritten on Rs. 60)\n* **Manufacturer Info:** \n  * **Mfd. by:** M/s Allkind Healthcare, Unit-II, Plot No. 114-A, Khasra Nos. 2214/2036/1785, 2219/2037/1785, 2224/2038/1785, EPIP, Phase-II, Village & Post Thana, Tehsil-Baddi, District-Solan (Himachal Pradesh), PIN-173205.\n  * **Mfg. Lic. No.:** MNB/21/1133, State Excise Lic. in Form L-19A.\n* **Marketed by / For Consumer Complaints contact:**\n  * Reckitt Benckiser Consumer Care at: Reckitt Benckiser (India) Pvt. Ltd., DLF Cyber Park, 6th & 7th Floor (Tower C), 405 B, Udyog Vihar Phase III, Sector 20, Gurugram-122016.\n  * **Toll Free Number:** 18001035012\n  * **Email:** ConsumerHealth_India